OL,3,GNEWSAWomen left feeling unsafe at night
OL,4,Aafter rape in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome women in a Dorset town have been
OL,7,Fleft feeling unsafe when walking alone
OL,8,Fat night after a woman was raped.
OL,10,FPolice are investigating after a woman
OL,11,Fin her 20s was raped in the popular
OL,12,Fseaside town of Weymouth on Monday
OL,13,Fnight.
OL,15,FAbigail Sedwards, 18, said that she was
OL,16,Fshocked about what happened and felt
OL,17,F"like young women aren't as protected
OL,18,Fas they should be".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
