OL,3,GNEWSAWomen left feeling unsafe at night
OL,4,Aafter rape in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset Police said: "We are committed
OL,7,Fto being here for the safety of women
OL,8,Fand girls in Weymouth and work with our
OL,9,Fpartners to ensure that victims of
OL,10,Fsexual offences are supported and feel
OL,11,Flistened to."
